  "resetDone": "Reset to default settings.",
  "privacyText": "This app is free. On first launch you create a simple profile with just a nickname. Your nickname and generation history are stored only on this device, are never sent to the operator, and can be deleted at any time in Settings → Delete account.\n\nThe app itself does not collect personally identifying information such as your name, phone number or email address.\n\nThe app uses Google AdMob to show ads. In that process, the advertising ID, device information and app usage information may be collected by Google. Where consent is required (e.g. in the EEA and UK), you are asked on first launch and can change your choice at any time in Settings → Ad privacy settings.\n\nThis information may be used to deliver ads, improve app quality and prevent abuse.",
  "disclaimerText": "This app is a tool that offers statistics on past winning numbers and helps you build number combinations.\n\nIn every lottery, each combination has exactly the same chance of winning the jackpot (e.g. 1 in 8,145,060 for Korea's Lotto 6/45 and 1 in 292,201,338 for Powerball). The filters and statistics in this app do not improve your odds. Please use them for fun and reference only.\n\nThis is an independent app and is not affiliated with any lottery operator (including Dong-hang Lottery, Powerball, Mega Millions, Lotto 6/49, EuroMillions, Eurojackpot, Loto 6, Irish Lotto or Vietlott).\n\nThe app does not guarantee any winnings. You are solely responsible for buying and playing lottery tickets.\n\nThe app does not sell tickets and offers no betting, cash rewards or gambling services.",
  "contactText": "If you have questions, find a bug or have a suggestion, please email us.\n\nOperator: 한지성\nEmail: jnhteamsoft@gmail.com\n\nWe usually reply within 3 business days.",
